Live VLM WebUI provides the WebRTC + Vision Language Model streaming server,
GPU/system monitoring, and RTSP camera support. The PhysioCoach team built the
physical-therapy layer on top of it: MediaPipe pose estimation, joint-angle rep
counting, range-of-motion (ROM) measurement, the exercise library, the
dual-camera pipeline, and the real-time coaching/feedback loop.

